    <!-- 启动参数：说明 -->
    <string name="param_desc_engine_fps">How fast the game engine itself updates the game world, separate from the display. 60 is the game\'s original speed; higher values make motion smoother but use more power.</string>
    <string name="param_desc_vsync">Syncs the game\'s frames with your screen\'s refresh rate to stop visual tearing. Leave it ON unless you see tearing or stutter.</string>
    <string name="param_desc_frames_queued">How many frames the game prepares ahead of what the screen shows. Lower numbers cut input lag; higher numbers can improve smoothness on weaker hardware.</string>
    <string name="param_desc_free_camera">Lets you move the camera freely around the world for exploring or testing, instead of following the gameplay camera. Meant for experimentation, not normal play.</string>

